{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8908ca2cd92f67f9","name":"Quick-Release Coupling","source":{"id":"source:reference-8908ca2cd92f67f9","title":"Quick-Release Coupling","revision":21088,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:08:29Z","sha256":"f4d3d9dd49c87dc18409dd4a82ce4a278f513abde9a7a28f6737f0edd3978304","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21088","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Quick-Release%20Coupling&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8908ca2cd92f67f9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["QUICK-RELEASE COUPLING\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEIGHT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Tool\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(2 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Appendage\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["50 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(5 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," require frequent changes of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tools"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tools"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," to carry out their designated tasks. A tool-sized Quick-Release Coupling allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," (or a mechanic) to swap a tool in two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Actions"},": one to detach the tool and one to attach another. Both the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tool Mount"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tool_Mount","referenceId":"reference:45d4e22b431825b6"}," and the tool must have Quick-Release Couplings.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Appendage-sized Quick Release Coupling allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," (or a mechanic) to swap an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"}," in two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Actions"},": one round to detach the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"}," and one round to attach another. Both the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," must have Quick-Release Couplings. A Tool-sized Quick-Release Coupling cannot be used with an Appendage-sized Coupling. Additionally, to swap out its own ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"}," or Tool, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," must have must have another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"}," capable of carrying out the task, usually a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hand","referenceId":"reference:fa18c06733fbbf41"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Claw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Claw","referenceId":"reference:587cfbbbcd42a71b"}," of sufficient size, strength, and agility. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," mechanic must also be capable of handling the weight of the tool or Appendage (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Accessories"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Accessories"},"). Swapping ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendages"}," with a Quick-Release Coupling does not require a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
